#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:5 cf220e62e5554de98ee53db26d0ff230
msgid "TAKEOFF Mode"
msgstr "TAKEOFF 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:7 ce7174afe120456c9cb456135ad3b9e0
msgid ""
"Automatic takeoff can be accomplished either as a mission control command in"
" AUTO mode (NAV_TAKEOFF) or by directly changing into the TAKEOFF mode. See "
"also the :ref:`automatic-takeoff` topic for general setup information for "
"automatic takeoffs."
msgstr ""
"自动起飞可以在AUTO模式下作为任务控制命令（NAV_TAKEOFF）完成，也可以直接切换到TAKEOFF模式来完成。有关自动起飞的一般设置信息，另请参见"
" :ref:`automatic-takeoff` 主题。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:10 e2b3dfcb609147f8b512fc53860599df
msgid "NAV_TAKEOFF Mission Command"
msgstr "NAV_TAKEOFF 任务命令"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:12 4a5236621e3744bd8a30bdfab78f2e86
msgid ""
"The takeoff mission command specifies a takeoff pitch and a target altitude."
" The takeoff mission item is considered complete when the plane has reached "
"the target altitude specified in the mission. The mission will then execute "
"its normal end of mission behavior if it runs out of commands in the mission"
" list. For Plane, this is RTL."
msgstr ""
"起飞任务命令指定起飞俯仰角和目标高度。当飞机达到任务中指定的目标高度时，起飞任务项目视为完成。如果任务列表中命令用尽，任务将执行正常的任务结束行为。对于Plane，这是RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:17 ceecaa57d1324a7688dd23c92abda3db
msgid "TAKEOFF Flight Mode"
msgstr "TAKEOFF 飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:19 91554bb0f01a406c911d231a8e81c2ba
msgid ""
"Automatic Takeoff is also a mode itself. When entered, the plane will use "
"maximum throttle as set by the :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` "
"parameter, climbing with :ref:`TKOFF_LVL_PITCH<TKOFF_LVL_PITCH>` maximum and"
" takeoff roll limits (:ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT<LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>` ) up to the "
":ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>` altitude. Then, it will loiter at "
":ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>` altitude until the mode is changed. If the plane"
" travels for :ref:`TKOFF_DIST<TKOFF_DIST>` from the point where the mode is "
"entered, before reaching :ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>` altitude, then it will "
"loiter at that spot, still trying to climb to :ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>`."
msgstr ""
"自动起飞也是一种模式本身。进入后，飞机将使用 :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` 参数设置的最大油门，在最大 "
":ref:`TKOFF_LVL_PITCH<TKOFF_LVL_PITCH>` "
"俯仰和起飞横滚限制（:ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT<LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>`）下爬升至 "
":ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>` 高度。之后，将在 :ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>` "
"高度盘旋等待，直到模式更改。如果飞机在到达 :ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>` 高度之前从进入模式的位置行进了 "
":ref:`TKOFF_DIST<TKOFF_DIST>` 的距离，则将在该位置盘旋，仍然尝试爬升至 "
":ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:23 65b8977c846e4ff399e8e27bfef06d24
msgid ""
"Once :ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>` is reached, or the loiter point "
"distance is reached, maximum throttle and takeoff roll limits "
"(:ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT<LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>` ) are stopped and normal "
"navigation begins towards the loiter point and altitude. Normally, "
":ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>` is 10 meters and is intended to limit "
"navigation (roll) in order to prevent wing tip ground strikes."
msgstr ""
"一旦达到 "
":ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>`，或达到盘旋点距离，最大油门和起飞横滚限制（:ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT<LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>`）将停止，并开始朝盘旋点和目标高度正常导航。通常，:ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>`"
" 为10米，旨在限制导航（横滚），以防止翼尖触地。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:25 2abffa1c84f44522b4ca7d1a62fd115f
msgid ""
"If the mode is entered while already flying, it will immediately begin "
"loitering as in LOITER mode if at or above :ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>` "
"altitude above ground, otherwise it will climb to that altitude and then "
"begin loitering ."
msgstr ""
"如果在已经飞行时进入该模式，并且当前高度在地面以上 :ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>` 高度或以上，则将立即像在 Loiter "
"模式中一样开始盘旋；否则，将爬升到该高度后再开始盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:27 84dc49d785314ee295537066ca8f8baf
msgid ""
"TAKEOFF mode can also be entered via a switch using an RCx_OPTION = 77, as "
"well as via normal selection by the flight mode channel."
msgstr "TAKEOFF 模式也可以通过设置 RCx_OPTION = 77 的开关进入，也可以通过飞行模式通道正常选择进入。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:30 a3f15c916b10447e88c97afde6d4a275
msgid "TAKEOFF Heading"
msgstr "TAKEOFF 航向"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:32 d6c7b8bf1b4b4b348cd12f0099a3946c
msgid ""
"Before takeoff it is important that the plane be pointing into the wind, and"
" be aligned with the runway (if a wheeled takeoff is used). The plane will "
"try to hold its heading during takeoff, with the initial heading set by the "
"direction the plane is facing when the takeoff starts. It is highly "
"recommended that a compass be enabled and properly configured for auto "
"takeoff, as takeoff with a GPS heading can lead to poor initial heading "
"control such that heading can different from the initial heading by tens of "
"degrees during the climb. While this may not be an issue for hand launches, "
"runway takeoffs require a compass for adequate heading control during the "
"takeoff rollout."
msgstr ""
"起飞前，飞机务必朝向迎风方向，并与跑道对齐（如果使用滑轮起飞）。飞机将在起飞时保持航向，初始航向由起飞开始时飞机朝向设定。强烈建议启用罗盘并正确配置以进行自动起飞，因为使用GPS航向起飞可能导致初始航向控制不佳，爬升过程中航向可能偏离初始航向数十度。虽然这对手抛起飞影响不大，但跑道起飞需要罗盘以确保在起飞滑跑过程中有足够的航向控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:40 9ae878bfe82c4ae4a09a08a92bb78cde
msgid ""
"If you are using a wheeled aircraft then you should look at the "
"``WHEELSTEER_*`` PID settings for controlling ground steering. If you are "
"hand launching or using a catapult you should look at the "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC<TKOFF_THR_MINACC>` and "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINSPD<TKOFF_THR_MINSPD>` parameters."
msgstr ""
"如果使用轮式飞机，应查看 ``WHEELSTEER_*`` PID设置以控制地面转向。如果手抛或使用弹射器，应查看 "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC<TKOFF_THR_MINACC>` 和 "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINSPD<TKOFF_THR_MINSPD>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:48 7c25b97d3a8047969e54c2b8a330ede6
msgid "TAKEOFF Throttle"
msgstr "TAKEOFF 油门"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:50 5e8ea529242d4f28b4bd117e77f425f9
msgid ""
"By default, Plane will set the throttle to "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` (or if that is 0, to "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`) up until it reaches :ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>`. "
"This behaviour is reflected in the :ref:`TKOFF_OPTIONS<TKOFF_OPTIONS>` bit 0"
" setting, which by default is 0 (unset)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Plane 将油门设置为 :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` （如果该值为0，则为 "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`），直到达到 :ref:`TKOFF_ALT<TKOFF_ALT>`。此行为反映在 "
":ref:`TKOFF_OPTIONS<TKOFF_OPTIONS>` 第0位的设置中，默认为0（未设置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:53 4648ea3f26764e9aa7cbbab271639365
msgid ""
"In case more fine-grained throttle control is required, an airspeed sensor "
"must be installed and enabled via the :ref:`ARPSD_USE<ARSPD_USE>` parameter "
"and :ref:`TKOFF_OPTIONS<TKOFF_OPTIONS>` bit 0 must be set to 1. IF no "
"airspeed sensor is enabled or :ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` is "
"enabled (not recommended), then this bit has no effect."
msgstr ""
"如果需要更精细的油门控制，必须安装空速传感器并通过 :ref:`ARPSD_USE<ARSPD_USE>` 参数启用，并且 "
":ref:`TKOFF_OPTIONS<TKOFF_OPTIONS>` 第0位必须设置为1。如果未启用空速传感器或启用了 "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` （不推荐），则此位无效。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:55 ceecaf36a68a49b993c6b0e510cfa1d0
msgid ""
"In this configuration, right after takeoff the throttle is set to "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` for "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX_T<TKOFF_THR_MAX_T>` or until "
":ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>` (whichever lasts longer)."
msgstr ""
"在此配置中，起飞后油门立即设置为 :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>`，持续 "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX_T<TKOFF_THR_MAX_T>` 或直到达到 "
":ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>` （以较长者为准）。"

#: ../../source/docs/takeoff-mode.rst:57 8523ca68b6374b7d97a03b07be583b9f
msgid ""
"Finally, the throttle will be managed by the TECS controller to achieve a "
"speed controlled, maximum (:ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>`) climb, "
"ranging between :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MIN<TKOFF_THR_MIN>` and "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>`."
msgstr ""
"最后，油门将由TECS控制器管理，在 :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MIN<TKOFF_THR_MIN>` 和 "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` "
"之间实现速度受控的最大爬升（:ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>`）。"

